The patches were written for Sync for Reddit by Laurence Dawson, which is not affiliated with this
project. Sync for Reddit itself is not included, modified in any repository copy, or redistributed
here; the patches only change an APK the user already has.

Parts of the approach were derived from these GPL-3.0 projects:

  revanced-rif-fixes (notBrian2)      https://github.com/notBrian2/revanced-rif-fixes
      The gallery /api/info to /comments rewrite, the morechildren to /comments rewrite and the
      imgur album metadata work were first done for rif is fun there.

  sync-reddit-fixes (trulow)          https://github.com/trulow/sync-reddit-fixes
      A Morphe port of the same fixes to Sync for Reddit, used as a reference for Sync's classes.

  patcheddit (wchill, KingOfPoptart)  https://github.com/wchill/patcheddit
      The original Redgifs temporary token and user agent handling.

The build scripts use the ReVanced CLI and patcher (GPL-3.0), R8/D8 (BSD-3-Clause), OkHttp and Okio
(Apache-2.0), Volley (Apache-2.0) and the Android SDK (Apache-2.0). None of them are redistributed
here; scripts/fetch-toolchain.sh downloads them from their upstream sources.
